10. Firmware Updates

Firmware / OS Updates

- Firmware-related updates are considered whenever a new mobile OS version is introduced.
- The team validates application compatibility with the updated OS versions.

Example:

New iOS / Android OS released
↓
Firmware / OS update
↓
Compatibility validation
↓
Mobile application testing

---

11. Network Validation

- Network-level validation is not primarily handled by the mobile testing team.
- Network validation/testing is handled separately.
- Network scenarios may involve different connectivity/network types such as:
  - 2G
  - 3G
  - 4G

The mobile team mainly focuses on application-level functionality and compatibility.

