12. Automation Readiness

The team is already considering automation for suitable mobile test scenarios.

Automation Approach

- Identify stable and repeatable manual test cases.
- Evaluate which scenarios can be automated.
- Approximately 75% of the current manual test coverage is considered suitable for automation.
- Automation can be integrated as part of the overall regression/validation process.

